1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,600
What if YOU could build the
perfect college applicant?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,500
We're creating a student
from scratch.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,550
And YOU are making
the decisions.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,550
They've got decent grades.

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,600
Now — their first big
extracurricular.

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,950
What should they do?

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,000
Option A — start a club.

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,000
Option B — build an app.

9
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,450
Option C — launch a
community project.

10
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:27,150
Comment A, B, or C.

11
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:30,150
Your choice decides
what happens next.

12
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:35,300
Let's see if we can build an
applicant worth remembering.
